{"turn_id": "d01-t1", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_data_used", "text": "The authors compared pronominal gender translation statistics against U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics data on the frequency of women's participation in each job position.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation", "text": "They compared the distribution of female workers with the frequency of female translations and found no correlation between those variables.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_real_distribution", "text": "The authors state that Google Translate outputs fail to reflect the real-world distribution of female workers, under-estimating the expected frequency.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "male_defaults_exceed_demographics", "text": "They report that Google Translate exhibits male defaults more frequently than job occupation data alone would suggest.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "sentences_from_gender_neutral_languages", "text": "The study built sentences such as 'He/She is an Engineer' in 12 different gender-neutral languages, including Hungarian, Chinese, and Yoruba, starting from a list of job positions from the U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "quantile_comparison", "text": "Using BLS data available for each individual occupation, the authors computed the frequency of women's participation for each 12-quantile and carried out the same computation for frequencies of translated female pronouns, plotting the histograms side-by-side.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d01-t2", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "study_design_neutral_languages", "text": "论文从美国劳工统计局（BLS）的职业列表出发，用12种性别中立语言（如匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语等）构造“He/She is an Engineer”这类句子，再用 Google Translate API 译为英语并统计译文中女性、男性及性别中立代词的出现频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "compare_with_bls_data", "text": "作者将代词性别翻译统计结果与 BLS 关于各职业女性从业比例的频率数据进行对照。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation_found", "text": "将女性从业者分布与女性译文频率相比较后，作者发现两者之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_real_distribution", "text": "作者指出，Google Translate 的输出未能反映女性从业者的真实分布，并且低估了预期的女性频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "male_defaults_exceed_demographics", "text": "即便不期望译文代词呈50:50分布，Google Translate 出现男性默认形式的频率也高于仅凭职业数据所能解释的程度。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "distribution_inverse_quantiles", "text": "按12分位计算，译文女性代词的分布呈持续的反向分布，女性代词集中于第一个12分位；而 BLS 数据显示女性从业比例在第四个12分位达到峰值，并在其后各分位仍保持显著。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "assumption_definition_of_bias", "text": "论文的假设是：译文性别代词分布虽可偏离50:50，但不应偏离到曲解职业人口统计特征的程度；若男性默认频率高估了某职业中男性雇员相对于女性雇员（可能本就不平等）的比例，则认定 Google Translate 存在负面性别偏见。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-bf50e77dea8722dc9d0a44b4"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
